/-!
# Cubic factor order-seven certificates

Packed matrices encode the word in inverse generators and changes of basis for
its six nonidentity powers. Each normal form has three fixed vectors and three
copies of each irreducible cubic factor of X⁷ − 1. The script in source/ merely
generates data; Certificates.lean checks every identity in the kernel.
The input matrices are the unchanged literal image coordinates from Degrees.
Source application: Guralnick–Malle, Proposition 4.3, pp.10–11;
Aschbacher–Smith K.2, printed p.453.
-/

